        "description": {
          "value": "<p>A creature within 60 feet must succeed on a DC 12 Strength saving throw or be restrained for 1 minute. The creature can use its action to make a DC 12 Strength check, freeing itself on a success. ##### Variant: Treant Wildcaller Although all treants can manipulate the forest to some degree, wildcallers can harness the full might of the wilderness. A treant wildcaller has a challenge rating of 3 (700 XP). It has 45 (7d8 + 14) hit points and the following trait.</p>",
